# What share of new cars sold in Norway are fully electric?
subtitle: "A host and an oil-country skeptic: drag a pie slice to guess Norway's share of fully electric new cars, then see how fast it got there."
tags: ["economics","data"]
format: quiz
thumb: "band \"Oil country, electric cars\" note \"How many?\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Kore | a firm, calm quiz host with a dry wit; clear","b":"gemini:Zephyr | a bright co-host with confident wrong hunches; natural, never exaggerated","take":"lines"}

## What share of new cars sold in Norway are fully electric?
use: pie_chart
with:
    labels:
      - Electric
      - Other
    values:
      - [95.4, 4.6]
      - [16.9, 83.1]
      - [0.3, 99.7]
    stage: 0
    box:
      x: 420
      'y': 170
      w: 560
      h: 460
sources:
    - id: owid
      title: Share of new cars sold that are electric (battery-electric and plug-in hybrid)
      authors: Our World in Data, from the International Energy Agency Global EV Outlook
      year: 2026
      url: https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/share-car-sales-battery-plugin
      finding: 'Norway, battery-electric share of new car sales: 0.3% in 2010, 16.9% in 2015, 89.2% in 2024, 95.4% in 2025; world 16.5% in 2025 (IEA figures for 2025 sales)'
    - id: elbil
      title: Norwegian EV policy
      authors: Norwegian EV Association (Norsk elbilforening)
      year: 2025
      finding: electric cars were long exempt from Norway's purchase tax and 25% VAT (VAT applies above NOK 500,000 since 2023), with lower tolls and other road perks

    icon car size 210 set twemoji x 220 y 495 icon_look picture of automobile hidden true
    icon flag size 80 set twemoji x 110 y 640 icon_look picture of "flag norway" hidden true
    text y25 "2025: 95%" #b5482e cites ["owid"] x 310 y 640 font_size 56 hidden true
    text y15 "2015: 17%" #b5482e cites ["owid"] x 310 y 640 font_size 56 hidden true
    text y10 "2010: 0.3%" #b5482e cites ["owid"] x 310 y 640 font_size 56 hidden true
    text tax "almost no tax, no VAT" #3d3833 cites ["elbil"] x 240 y 320 font_size 40 hidden true
    icon oil size 130 set twemoji x 220 y 290 icon_look picture of "oil drum" hidden true
    shape w_disc #2f6b8f shape circle x 150 y 255 radius 85 style.fill #2f6b8f style.fill_style wash style.opacity 0.35 hidden true
    sector w_slice #b5482e cites ["owid"] x 150 y 255 radius 85 start 28.8 end 90 style.fill #b5482e hidden true
    text w_l "World: 17%" #8a5fa8 cites ["owid"] x 330 y 290 font_size 44 hidden true
    group w_grp members ["w_disc","w_slice","w_l"] hidden true

    card title "How many new cars in Norway are electric?"

A: In Norway last year, what share of new cars ran on batteries alone? Not hybrids: fully electric.
    draw car flag

B: Norway? The oil country? Can't be many.
    highlight flag

    ask "Drag the slice's edge to your guess." on slice_1 store g default "50"
        right: Good guess. Nearly all of them.
        wrong: Off the mark. Look how much of the pie is electric.

A: About ninety-five percent. Nineteen of every twenty new cars.
    draw y25

B: Fine, but that must have taken decades.
    highlight slice_1

    erase y25

A: Ten years. In 2015 it was about one in six.
    animate stage 1 duration 2.5

    draw y15

    erase y15

A: And in 2010, about three cars in a thousand.
    animate stage 2 duration 2

    draw y10

B: So what happened? Did Norwegians just fall in love with batteries?
    draw tax

A: Mostly money: electric cars paid almost no purchase tax or VAT, and lower tolls.
    highlight tax

    erase tax

B: While selling oil and gas to everyone else. Very Norwegian.
    draw oil

    erase oil y10

    animate stage 1 duration 1.5

A: And the world? About one new car in six is fully electric: Norway in 2015.
    draw w_disc w_slice w_l

B: So the world is ten years behind a country that sells it oil. Ten more years, then?
    animate stage 0 duration 2.5

## Thumbnail
role: thumbnail

    icon t_car size 280 set twemoji x 300 y 430 icon_look picture of automobile hidden true
    icon t_plug size 110 set twemoji x 300 y 610 icon_look picture of "electric plug" hidden true
    text t_q "?%" #b5482e x 720 y 440 font_size 200 hidden true
    thumb t_band "Fully electric, in Norway?" kind band hidden true

## Thumbnail
role: thumbnail

    icon t2_oil size 260 set twemoji x 290 y 450 icon_look picture of "oil drum" hidden true
    icon t2_bat size 260 set twemoji x 710 y 450 icon_look picture of battery hidden true
    thumb t2_band "The oil country that went electric" kind band hidden true

## Thumbnail
role: thumbnail

    icon t3_flag size 270 set twemoji x 300 y 450 icon_look picture of "flag norway" hidden true
    text t3_a "2015: 17%" #2f6b8f x 700 y 520 font_size 80 hidden true
    text t3_b "2025: ?" #b5482e x 700 y 380 font_size 80 hidden true
    thumb t3_band "Ten years later…" kind band hidden true
